{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "about": "Single source for the Pamodzi design tokens. scripts/tokens.mjs generates src/design/generated/tokens.css from this file and tests/quality/contrast.cjs reads the contrast rules at the bottom. A breaking change to a token name or value bumps the major version and is recorded in the decision log in ARCHITECTURE.md.",
  "breakpoints": {
    "sm": 640,
    "md": 900,
    "lg": 1200
  },
  "fonts": {
    "head": {
      "family": "MTN Brighter Sans",
      "use": "Headings, menus, buttons, labels, figures and anything set bold",
      "faces": [
        {
          "weights": [100, 900],
          "file": "assets/fonts/mtn-brighter-sans-bold.woff2",
          "sizeAdjust": "100%",
          "fallback": {
            "local": ["Arial Bold", "Arial-BoldMT"],
            "sizeAdjust": "105.6%",
            "ascentOverride": "92.4%",
            "descentOverride": "30.7%",
            "lineGapOverride": "0.0%"
          }
        }
      ],
      "tabularFigures": true
    },
    "body": {
      "family": "Sky Text",
      "use": "Paragraphs, forms, captions. Sky Text has one weight, so bold and semibold runs borrow MTN Brighter Sans Bold",
      "faces": [
        {
          "weights": [100, 500],
          "file": "assets/fonts/sky-text-regular.woff2",
          "sizeAdjust": "106%",
          "fallback": {
            "local": ["Arial"],
            "sizeAdjust": "102.9%",
            "ascentOverride": "90.6%",
            "descentOverride": "21.6%",
            "lineGapOverride": "2.6%"
          }
        },
        {
          "weights": [600, 900],
          "file": "assets/fonts/mtn-brighter-sans-bold.woff2",
          "sizeAdjust": "106%",
          "fallback": {
            "local": ["Arial Bold", "Arial-BoldMT"],
            "sizeAdjust": "111.9%",
            "ascentOverride": "92.4%",
            "descentOverride": "30.7%",
            "lineGapOverride": "0.0%"
          }
        }
      ],
      "tabularFigures": false
    },
    "fallback": "\"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif",
    "italics": false,
    "aliases": {
      "head": [
        "Archivo",
        "Bricolage Grotesque",
        "DM Serif Display",
        "Instrument Serif",
        "JetBrains Mono",
        "Geist Mono Variable",
        "Montserrat"
      ],
      "body": ["Lexend", "Manrope", "Inter Variable"]
    },
    "about": "Two house typefaces, both self-hosted woff2 files (28 KB together) designed by Newlyn: MTN Brighter Sans Bold leads, Sky Text reads. Sky Text has a single Regular weight, so its 600 to 900 weights are the MTN Bold file: bold words inside paragraphs and every semibold label stay on brand and never fall back to a faked bold. MTN Brighter Sans has tabular figures, so money and counts are set in it; Sky Text has proportional figures. Neither font has the arrow glyphs, which fall back to the system font. Fallback faces are tuned to Arial metrics so text does not jump when the fonts arrive. The aliases list names that older stylesheets still use; each resolves to the same two files, so no other typeface is ever downloaded. Sky Text is drawn about 9% smaller in x-height than the Lexend it replaced, so its faces carry size-adjust 106%: that keeps reading size unchanged for every stylesheet, and the bold borrowed from MTN Brighter Sans carries the same adjustment so bold words match the text around them."
  },
  "type": {
    "display": "clamp(2.5rem, 1.6rem + 4.2vw, 5rem)",
    "h1": "clamp(2.125rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 3.75rem)",
    "h2": "clamp(1.75rem, 1.35rem + 1.8vw, 2.75rem)",
    "h3": "clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.7vw, 1.625rem)",
    "h4": "1.125rem",
    "lead": "clamp(1.125rem, 1.05rem + 0.4vw, 1.3125rem)",
    "body": "clamp(1rem, 0.97rem + 0.15vw, 1.0625rem)",
    "small": "0.875rem",
    "caption": "0.8125rem",
    "figure": "clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 2.4vw, 3.5rem)",
    "measure": "60ch"
  },
  "space": {
    "1": 4,
    "2": 8,
    "3": 12,
    "4": 16,
    "5": 24,
    "6": 32,
    "7": 48,
    "8": 64,
    "9": 96,
    "10": 128
  },
  "layout": {
    "gutter": "clamp(16px, 4vw, 56px)",
    "shell": "1240px",
    "section": "clamp(64px, 8vw, 128px)"
  },
  "radius": {
    "s": "8px",
    "m": "16px",
    "l": "24px",
    "pill": "999px",
    "arch": "999px 999px 0 0"
  },
  "layers": {
    "raised": 10,
    "sticky": 40,
    "header": 50,
    "overlay": 70,
    "modal": 80,
    "toast": 90
